#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Neat` class usage {#neat-class-usage}"
msgstr "Paggamit ng `Neat` class {#neat-class-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting a resource-intensive Qiskit Runtime workload to execute on"
" hardware, you can use the Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator Analyzer "
"Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools-"
"neat#neat) class to verify that your Estimator workload is set up correctly,"
" is likely to return  accurate results, uses the most appropriate options "
"for the specified problem, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago mag-submit ng resource-intensive na Qiskit Runtime workload para "
"patakbuhin sa hardware, maaari mong gamitin ang Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` "
"(Noisy Estimator Analyzer Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/debug-tools-neat#neat) class para ma-verify na tama ang setup ng"
" iyong Estimator workload, malamang na magbabalik ito ng tumpak na resulta, "
"gumagamit ng pinaka-angkop na mga opsyon para sa tinukoy na problema, at "
"marami pa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Neat` Cliffordizes the input circuits for efficient simulation, while retaining its structure and depth. Clifford circuits suffer similar levels of noise and are a good proxy for studying the original circuit of interest.\n"
"First, import the relevant packages and [authenticate to the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `Neat` ay nag-Cliffordize ng mga input circuit para sa mas mahusay na simulation, habang pinapanatili ang istruktura at lalim nito. Ang mga Clifford circuit ay nakakaranas ng katulad na antas ng ingay at magandang proxy para pag-aralan ang orihinal na circuit na pinag-aaralan.\n"
"Una, i-import ang mga kaugnay na package at [mag-authenticate sa Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the environment {#prepare-the-environment}"
msgstr "Ihanda ang kapaligiran {#prepare-the-environment}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a target circuit {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"
msgstr "I-initialize ang target na circuit {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Consider a six-qubit circuit that has the following properties:\n"
msgstr ""
"Isaalang-alang ang isang anim-na-qubit circuit na may mga sumusunod na "
"katangian:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternates between random `RZ` rotations and layers of `CNOT` gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagpapalitan sa pagitan ng mga random na `RZ` rotation at mga layer ng "
"`CNOT` gate.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Has a mirror structure, that is, it applies a unitary `U` followed by its "
"inverse.\n"
msgstr ""
"May mirror na istruktura, ibig sabihin, nag-apply ito ng unitary `U` kasunod"
" ang inverse nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose single-Pauli `Z` operators as observables and use them to initialize "
"the primitive unified blocs (PUBs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumili ng single-Pauli `Z` operator bilang mga observable at gamitin ang mga"
" ito para i-initialize ang mga primitive unified bloc (PUB).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuits {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"
msgstr "I-Cliffordize ang mga circuit {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The previously defined PUB circuits are not Clifford, which makes them "
"difficult to simulate classically. However, you can use the `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method to map them to Clifford circuits for more "
"efficient simulation.  The "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method is a wrapper around the "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford) transpiler pass, which "
"can also be used independently. In particular, it replaces non-Clifford "
"single-qubit gates in the original circuit with Clifford single-qubit gates,"
" but it does not mutate the two-qubit gates, number of qubits, or circuit "
"depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga PUB circuit na tinukoy kanina ay hindi Clifford, kaya mahirap "
"i-simulate nang klasikal. Gayunpaman, maaari mong gamitin ang `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method para i-map ang mga ito sa mga Clifford "
"circuit para sa mas mahusay na simulation. Ang "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method ay isang wrapper sa paligid ng "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford) transpiler pass, na "
"maaari ring gamitin nang hiwalay. Sa partikular, pinapalitan nito ang mga "
"non-Clifford single-qubit gate sa orihinal na circuit ng mga Clifford "
"single-qubit gate, ngunit hindi nito binabago ang mga two-qubit gate, bilang"
" ng qubit, o lalim ng circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for more information about Clifford circuit simulation.\n"
"First, initialize `Neat`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) para sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa Clifford circuit simulation.\n"
"Una, i-initialize ang `Neat`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, Cliffordize the PUBs.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-Cliffordize ang mga PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 1: Analyze the impact of noise on the circuit outputs "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasyon 1: Suriin ang epekto ng ingay sa mga output ng circuit "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example shows how to use `Neat` to study the impact of different noise "
"models on PUBs as a function of circuit depth by running simulations in both"
" ideal ([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/debug-tools-neat#ideal_sim)) and noisy "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)) conditions. This can be useful to set up expectations"
" on the quality of the experimental results before running a job on a QPU. "
"To learn more about noise models, see [Exact and noisy simulation with "
"Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer#exact-and-noisy-"
"simulation-with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng halimbawang ito kung paano gamitin ang `Neat` para pag-aralan"
" ang epekto ng iba't ibang noise model sa mga PUB bilang function ng lalim "
"ng circuit sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng mga simulation sa parehong "
"ideal ([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/debug-tools-neat#ideal_sim)) at maingay "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)) na kondisyon. Maaari itong maging kapaki-pakinabang "
"para magtakda ng inaasahan sa kalidad ng mga eksperimental na resulta bago "
"magpatakbo ng job sa QPU. Para matuto pa tungkol sa mga noise model, tingnan"
" ang [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer "
"primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer#exact-and-noisy-simulation-"
"with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simulated results support mathematical operations, and can therefore be "
"compared with each other (or with experimental results) to calculate figures"
" of merit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga simulate na resulta ay sumusuporta sa mga mathematical na operasyon,"
" at samakatuwid ay maaaring ikumpara sa isa't isa (o sa mga eksperimental na"
" resulta) para kalkulahin ang mga figure of merit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"A QPU can be affected by different kinds of noise. The Qiskit Aer noise model used here only simulates some of them and therefore is likely to be less severe than the noise on a real QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Ang QPU ay maaaring maapektuhan ng iba't ibang uri ng ingay. Ang Qiskit Aer noise model na ginagamit dito ay nag-simulate lamang ng ilan sa mga ito at samakatuwid ay malamang na hindi gaanong matindi kumpara sa ingay sa tunay na QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For details on what errors are included when initializing a noise model from a QPU, see the Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mga detalye kung anong mga error ang kasama kapag nag-initialize ng noise model mula sa isang QPU, tingnan ang Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Begin by performing ideal and noisy classical simulations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magsimula sa pagsasagawa ng ideal at maingay na klasikal na simulation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, apply mathematical operations to compute the absolute difference. The "
"remainder of the guide uses the absolute difference as a figure of merit to "
"compare ideal results with noisy or experimental results, but similar "
"figures of merit can be set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, mag-apply ng mga mathematical na operasyon para kalkulahin ang "
"absolute difference. Ang natitirang bahagi ng gabay ay gumagamit ng absolute"
" difference bilang figure of merit para ikumpara ang mga ideal na resulta sa"
" mga maingay o eksperimental na resulta, ngunit maaari ring mag-set up ng "
"katulad na mga figure of merit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The absolute difference shows that the impact of noise grows with the "
"circuits' sizes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng absolute difference na lumalaki ang epekto ng ingay habang "
"lumalaki ang laki ng mga circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can follow these rough and simplified guidelines to improve circuits of "
"this type:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong sundin ang mga magaspang at simplipikadong alituntuning ito para"
" mapabuti ang mga circuit ng ganitong uri:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is greater than 90%, mitigation will likely "
"not help.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ang mean absolute difference ay mas malaki sa 90%, malamang na hindi "
"makakatulong ang mitigation.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 90%, [Probabilistic Error "
"Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) will likely be able to "
"improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ang mean absolute difference ay mas mababa sa 90%, malamang na "
"mapapabuti ng [Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-"
"mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea)"
" ang mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 80%, [ZNE with gate "
"folding](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-"
"extrapolation-zne) will also likely be able to improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ang mean absolute difference ay mas mababa sa 80%, malamang na "
"mapapabuti rin ng [ZNE with gate folding](/guides/error-mitigation-and-"
"suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne) ang mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because all of the absolute differences above are less than 90%, applying PEA to the original circuit will hopefully improve the quality of its results.\n"
"You can specify different noise models in the analyzer. The following example performs the same test but adds a custom noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil lahat ng absolute difference sa itaas ay mas mababa sa 90%, ang pag-apply ng PEA sa orihinal na circuit ay malamang na magpapabuti ng kalidad ng mga resulta nito.\n"
"Maaari kang tumukoy ng iba't ibang noise model sa analyzer. Ipinapakita ng sumusunod na halimbawa ang parehong test ngunit may dagdag na custom na noise model.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As shown, given a noise model, you can try to quantify the impact of noise "
"on the (Cliffordized version of the) PUBs of interest before running them on"
" a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulad ng ipinapakita, sa isang noise model, maaari mong subukang sukatin ang"
" epekto ng ingay sa (Cliffordized na bersyon ng) mga PUB na pinag-aaralan "
"bago patakbuhin ang mga ito sa QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 2: Benchmark different strategies {#application-2-benchmark-"
"different-strategies}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasyon 2: I-benchmark ang iba't ibang estratehiya "
"{#application-2-benchmark-different-strategies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example uses `Neat` to help identify the best options for your PUBs. To"
" do so, consider running an estimation problem with PEA, which cannot be "
"simulated with `qiskit_aer`. You can use `Neat` to help determine which "
"noise amplification factors will work best, then use those factors when "
"running the original experiment on a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagamit ng halimbawang ito ang `Neat` para matukoy ang pinakamabuting mga "
"opsyon para sa iyong mga PUB. Para gawin ito, isaalang-alang ang "
"pagpapatakbo ng estimation problem gamit ang PEA, na hindi maaaring "
"i-simulate gamit ang `qiskit_aer`. Maaari mong gamitin ang `Neat` para "
"matukoy kung aling mga noise amplification factor ang pinaka-epektibo, "
"pagkatapos ay gamitin ang mga factor na iyon kapag pinatakbo ang orihinal na"
" eksperimento sa QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result with the smallest difference suggests which options to choose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang resulta na may pinakamaliit na pagkakaiba ay nagmumungkahi kung anong "
"mga opsyon ang pipiliin.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Read an overview of [Qiskit debugging tools](/guides/debugging-tools).\n"
"- Learn about [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"- Learn about [available Qiskit Runtime options](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Learn about [Error mitigation and suppression techniques](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"
"- Visit the [Transpile with pass managers](transpile-with-pass-managers) topic.\n"
"- Learn [how to transpile circuits](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) as part of Qiskit patterns workflows using Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Review the [Debugging tools API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Basahin ang pangkalahatang-ideya ng [mga Qiskit debugging tool](/guides/debugging-tools).\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [mga available na Qiskit Runtime option](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [mga teknik ng Error mitigation at suppression](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"
"- Bisitahin ang paksa na [Transpile with pass managers](transpile-with-pass-managers).\n"
"- Matuto [kung paano mag-transpile ng mga circuit](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) bilang bahagi ng mga Qiskit patterns workflow gamit ang Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Suriin ang [Debugging tools API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
